300,103771800,73772000,71430100,54116700,42876700,63704900]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.unisemgroup.com","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":3655,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Unisem (M) Berhad, together with its subsidiaries, provides semiconductor assembly and test services for electronic companies in Asia, Europe, and the United States. The company offers packaging and leadframe packaging services including advanced integrated circuit packaging technology, such as wafer bump, redistribution layer design and fabrication, flip chip interconnect, and wafer level chip scale packaging, as well as a range of leadframe and substrate integrated circuit packages. It also provides test services comprising wafer probe and final testing on test equipment covering test platforms, such as radio frequency, analog, digital, and mixed signal; and test related services comprising reliability testing, thermal and electrical characterization, dry pack, and tape and reel. In addition, the company offers turnkey services, including design, assembly, test, failure analysis, warehousing, and drop-ship services. Further, the company engages in marketing, administrative, and other support services. It serves its products to the fabless companies and integrated device manufacturers. The company was incorporated in 1989 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Unisem (M) Berhad 成立于1989年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，为亚洲、欧洲和美国的电子公司提供半导体封装和测试服务。公司服务于无晶圆厂公司和集成器件制造商。","lines":["封装服务：提供包括晶圆凸块、重分布层设计和制造、倒装芯片互连、晶圆级芯片尺寸封装等先进集成电路封装技术，以及引线框架和基板集成电路封装。","测试服务：提供晶圆探测和最终测试，覆盖射频、模拟、数字和混合信号等测试平台。","测试相关服务：提供可靠性测试、热和电特性分析、干包装和卷带服务。","一站式服务：提供设计、组装、测试、故障分析、仓储和直发服务。","营销及支持服务：从事营销、行政和其他支持服务。"],"lines_en":["Packaging services: Offer advanced IC packaging technologies such as wafer bump, redistribution layer design and fabrication, flip chip interconnect, and wafer level chip scale packaging, as well as leadframe and substrate IC packages.","Test services: Provide wafer probe and final testing on test platforms covering RF, analog, digital, and mixed signal.","Test-related services: Include reliability testing, thermal and electrical characterization, dry pack, and tape and reel.","Turnkey services: Include design, assembly, test, failure analysis, warehousing, and drop-ship services.","Marketing and support services: Engage in marketing, administrative, and other support services."]}}